Marvel VS Capcom 2 Vita changelog

v1.2
- Online versus VS MODE. (BETA)
- Setup menu at start (hold SELECT while the game starts to open it again).
- Game speed option: iOS speed by default, or Normal, Turbo 1, Turbo 2 or the game's own choice.
- Classic controls by default, L assist 1, R assist 2, L + R Variable Combination.
- Widescreen.
- Stage floors drawn with perspective (no more stretched floors).
- Hyper combo backgrounds no longer look garbled.
- Better performance on heavy stages and in loading screens.
- Removed CAPCOM startup logo.
- The D-pad now works in the Command List and Secret Factor.
- Added new live area assets.

v1.1
- Added 60 fps.
- L + R: Hyper Combo.

v1.0
- Initial release.
